      "message": "Note that clients aren\u0027t required to extend this class; this is simply a utility class to wrap exceptions that can\u0027t be mutated (like java.* classes).\n\nI agree that extending Parcelable classes is fraught with trouble, so I\u0027m happy to make this class final to prevent that.\n\nIn a future CL I\u0027m planning to introduce something like:\n\n  class UserActionRequiredException extends SecurityException implements Parcelable {}\n\nWhich the Parcel code would gladly transport across without involving this class here.",
